      "is_best": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p> </p><p>Indeed: WYSI<u><strong>N</strong></u>WYG - What You See Is <em><strong>Not</strong></em> What You Get !</p><p> </p><p>And the so-called “Preview” within the code editor shows something different again!</p><p> </p><p>Screenshot of the code editor (note the “preview” at the bottom):</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/21b34ec5-196a-443c-985b-e78350e1d20d.png\"/></figure><p> </p><p> </p><p>Screenshot of what it puts into the message editor:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/dda2a0f5-0a67-43d8-83f6-12f8280762d4.png\"/></figure><p>screenshot of how that appears when posted:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/e7df027f-c81d-4915-8aec-377e04bf5393.png\"/></figure><p> </p></div>"
    },
